# MARTIAL ARTIST

{{note,large,classDetails
**Key Stats:** DEX, STR   **Hit Die:** 1d8  **Starting HP:** 13
:
**Saves:** DEX+, INT-   **Armor:** Cloth   **Weapons:** None
:
**Starting Gear:** Adventuring Garb, Camping Supplies
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 1
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Fighting Styles.**. Gain the Offensive Position and Defensive Position Stances. 
:
**Stances.** Action: Enter a Stance that you know. While in the Stance, you gain its attack, defense bonus, and ability. You stay in the Stance until combat ends, or you gain the Prone, Grappled, Restrained, Incapacitated, or Dying condition. You can only be in one Stance at a time, but can swap to a different Stance with an Action.
:
**Practiced Blows**. When not in a Stance, your unarmed attacks deal 1d6 + KEY damage.



}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 2
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Flow of Battle.** When you swap from one Stance to another for the first time each turn, and at the end of each turn that you attacked, roll a Flow Die (d6) and set it aside. You can have a max of 5 Flow Dice.
:
**Mortal Strike.** When you hit with an attack, you may expend any amount of Flow Dice to deal additional damage equal to their value.
:
**Sturdy Wall.** When you Defend, you may expend a Flow Die and add its value to your Defense.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 3
     Subclass
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Subclass**. Choose a Martial Artist subclass.
:
**Ready for Danger.** When you roll Initiative, enter a Stance for free.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 4
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Depth of Form**. Choose 2 additional Stances to learn.
:
**Key Stat Increase**. +1 DEX or STR.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 5
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Whipping Limbs** You can use Opportunity Attack on an enemy that enters your Reach.
:
**Enhanced Focus.** Your Flow Dice are now d8s.
:
**Secondary Stat Increase**. +1 INT or WIL.
}}



{{pageNumber}}

\page

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 6
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Depth of Form (2)**. Choose 2 additional Stances to learn. Choose a Stance you know and gain its Mastery ability. Mastery abilities are active as long as you are in the associated Stance.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 7
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Subclass**. Gain your Martial Artist subclass feature.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 8
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Whipping Limbs (2)** You can use Opportunity Attack more than once in a round.
:
**Key Stat Increase**. +1 DEX or STR.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 9
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Depth of Form (3)**. Choose 2 additional Stances to learn. Choose a Stance you know and gain its Mastery ability.
:
**Enhanced Focus (3)**. Your Flow Dice are now d10s.
:
**Secondary Stat Increase**. +1 INT or WIL.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 10
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Solid Body.** You gain Advantage on STR saves.
:
**Whipping Limbs (3)**. Your Opportunity Attacks negate one instance of disadvantage.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 11
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Subclass**. Gain your Martial Artist subclass feature.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 12
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Unbroken Rhythm.** When you make a save, you may spend a Flow Die and add its value to the save.
:
**Key Stat Increase**. +1 DEX or STR.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 13
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Depth of Form (4)**. Choose 2 additional Stances to learn. Choose a Stance you know and gain its Mastery ability.
:
**Secondary Stat Increase**. +1 INT or WIL.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 14
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Enhanced Focus (5)**. Your Flow Dice are now d12s.
:
**Whipping Limbs (4)**. When an enemy attack misses you or deals no damage to you, you may Opportunity Attack them if they are in your Reach.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 15
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Subclass**. Gain your Martial Artist subclass feature.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 16
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Depth of Form (5).** 2 additional Stances to learn. Choose a Stance you know and gain its Mastery ability.
:
**Key Stat Increase**. +1 DEX or STR.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 17
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Whipping Limbs (5)**. When you use an Opportunity Attack against a target, if you deal 20+ damage, their movement stops and they cannot move more this turn.
:
**Secondary Stat Increase**. +1 INT or WIL.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 18
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Muscle Memory**. When you roll Initiative, choose a Stance. You have access to that Stance’s attack even if you are not in that Stance.
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 19
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Epic Boon**. Choose an Epic Boon (see pg. 23 of the GM's Guide).
}}

<!-- =========================================================
     LEVEL 20
     ========================================================= -->

{{level
**Universal Legend.** +1 to any 2 of your stats. (1/turn) Enter a Stance for free.
}}

