# Stances
{{note,small,wide
<div style="font-size:10px">
<i><b>Action:</b> Enter a Stance that you know. While in the Stance, you gain its attack, defense bonus, and ability. You stay in the Stance until combat ends, or you gain the Prone, Grappled, Incapacitated, or Dying condition. You can only be in one Stance at a time, but can swap to a different Stance with an Action. Your Stances do not qualify for the dual-wield bonus even if both of your hands are empty.</i>
</div>
}}

{{note2,wide

<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
Offensive Stance
</span><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
1d8 + STR | DEF + 0
</span></div>

(1/turn) When you attack, do so with advantage.
:
<b>Mastery.</b> When you spend Flow Dice on Mortal Strike, double the value of one of them.
}}
{{note2,wide

<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
Defensive Stance
</span><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
1d8 + DEX | DEF + 2
</span></div>

If you did not move in your last turn, gain +4 Defense.
:
<b>Mastery.</b> When you spend a Flow Die on Sturdy Wall, deal damage equal to your Defense to the attacking foe.
}}

{{note2,wide

<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
White Crane
</span><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
1d6 + (DEX x 2) | DEF + 2
</span></div>

+2 Speed, and move through enemies and difficult terrain without penalty.
:
<b>Mastery.</b> When you use Sturdy Wall, you may first move up to the expended Flow Die's value (if this puts you out of line of sight/Reach/Range, the attack misses).
}}

{{note2,wide

<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
Cruel Tiger
</span><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
3d4 + STR | DEF + 0
</span></div>

On crit: +10 damage. (1/encounter) When you deal 20 or more damage in a single attack, you may Incapacitate the target until the end of their next turn.
:
<b>Mastery.</b> Any of your damage dice can be the Primary Die.
}}

{{note2,wide

<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
Pouncing Leopard
</span><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
1d8 + STR | DEF + 0
</span></div>

+4 Speed. In a turn in which you moved, your attacks deal an additional die of damage. This ability functions once per target.
:
<b>Mastery.</b> Your attacks are not subject to the disadvantage imposed by Rushed Strikes as long as you are striking a different target each time.
}}

{{note2,wide

<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
Fanged Snake
</span><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
1d4 + DEX | DEF + 0
</span></div>

On hit: Poisoned until the end of their next turn. Your attack’s damage ignores armor.
:
<b>Mastery.</b> Your attacks against foes with harmful conditions deal an additional +LVL damage.
}}


{{pageNumber}}

\page

{{note2,wide

<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
Fierce Dragon
</span><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
1d20 | DEF + 0
</span></div>

(1/turn) When you hit with an attack, you may deal the same damage to another foe within Reach.
:
<b>Mastery.</b> (1/encounter) 2 Actions (Cone 4): Deal 2d20 fire damage. 
}}
{{note2,wide

<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
