</span><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
1d8 + 1d6 + 1d4 | DEF + 2
</span></div>

Attacks miss you on a 1 or 2. After an attack misses you, your next attack gains advantage.
:
<b>Mastery.</b> When an attack misses you or deals no damage to you, gain a Flow Die at maximum value.
:
<i>When rolling for Advantage or Disadvantage, roll additional d8 dice. Your primary die is still your left-most die.</i>
}}

{{note2,wide

<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
Ember Rain
</span><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
1d10 + DEX | DEF + 0
</span></div>

When you deal 10 or more damage to an enemy, they gain Smoldering. When you hit a Smoldering enemy, double the value of your attack die/dice for damage calculation (this does not include Flow Dice).
:
<b>Mastery.</b> (1/encounter) When you apply Smoldering to an enemy, you may apply Smoldering to all other enemies.
}}

{{note2,wide

<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
Crashing Mountain
</span><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
1d6 + (2 x STR) | DEF + 4
</span></div>
You cannot be moved against your will. Defending does not cost an action.
:
<b>Mastery.</b> Your attacks deal additional damage equal to your Defense.
}}

{{note2,wide

<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
Flowing River
</span><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
2d6 + DEX | DEF + 2
</span></div>

On hit: Slowed. Increase your Primary Die value by 1 against Hampered targets.
:
<b>Mastery.</b> (1/encounter) When you attack a Hampered enemy, you may pull all enemies within Reach 6 to be as close as possible to that enemy.
}}

{{note2,wide

<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
Tearing Gale
</span><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
 2d4 + DEX | DEF + 2
</span></div>

Your attacks have +2 Reach and gain Vicious.
:
<b>Mastery.</b> Your attack gains knockback 2.
}}
{{note2,wide

<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; margin-bottom:2px;"><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
Umbral Fist (Master of Swirling Shadows Subclass)
</span><span style="font-family:beaufort-pro; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:900; font-style:italic; white-space:nowrap;">
1d8 + DEX | DEF + 0
</span></div>

When you enter this stance, you may teleport adjacent to an enemy that you can see. The first attack you hit after teleporting this way inflicts Blind.
:
<b>Mastery.</b>  Ranged attacks have disadvantage against you. <i>(Can only be gained via Cloak of Shadows)</i>
}}
